<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Corp said on Tuesday it was lowering its short-term rating on Ascend Communications Inc to hold from buy but maintaining its long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Michael Karfopoulos said in a research note he was lowering his fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.57 per share from $1.69 per share and his 1998 estimate to $1.97 per share from $2.04 per share.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Ascend's shares were off 5-3/4 at 41-7/8.</p>
<p>(Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
